<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>We've Rebranded - My Body Health & Wellness</title>
  <style>
    /* Import Google Font */
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap');

    /* Global Styles */
    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #4157b7, #4157b7);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .container {
      background: white;
      padding: 50px 50px 50px; /* Increased top padding */
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      max-width: 600px;
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in-out;
      overflow: visible; /* Ensure nothing is clipped */
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
      color: #2c3e50;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 26px;
      color: #16a085;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 300px;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      animation: popIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
      transform-origin: top center; /* Anchor scaling at the top */
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #16a085;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(22, 160, 133, 0.4);
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #138a75;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #888;
    }

    /* Animations */
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scale(0.9);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
      }
    }

    @keyframes popIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scale(0.8);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img class="logo" alt="Logo" src="images/testrxmd/MyBodyLogo.png" />
    <h1>Welcome to My Body Health & Wellness</h1>
    <p>
      We are thrilled to announce that <strong>TestRxMD</strong> is now <strong>My Body Health & Wellness</strong>! 
      While our name has changed, our commitment to your health and well-being remains stronger than ever. 
      Our new identity reflects our expanded mission to provide holistic care and personalized wellness solutions for you.
    </p>
    <p>
      Explore our refreshed website and discover new ways to achieve your health goals. Thank you for trusting us on this journey.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="btn">Explore Our Website</a>
    <p class="footer">&copy; 2025 My Body Health & Wellness. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
